+UI Elements (controller button glyphs) by Mikkel Julian "Arks" Petersen (Arks @ScissorMarks)
+  https://arks.itch.io  -  https://twitter.com/ScissorMarks
+  Xbox Buttons: https://arks.itch.io/xbox-buttons   (c) 2020 ArksDigital, CC BY 4.0
+  PS4 Buttons:  https://arks.itch.io/ps4-buttons    (c) 2020 ArksDigital, CC BY 4.0
+  License: http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
+  Changes: resized from 480x480 to 128x128 PNG and renamed by button position (south, east, ...).
+    PlayStation: style 1 / pressed style 2 ("- 2" files); Share, Options, Touchpad and the whole D-pad have no
+    pressed version in the pack (pressed = same image).
+    Xbox: face buttons style 1 / pressed style 3; sticks raised (4, 5) / pressed flat (1, 2); View, Menu 1 / 2;
+    Home white / pressed green. The bumpers, triggers and D-pad arrows (dark 1-4) have no pressed version in the
+    pack: their pressed images are the same art with the button body darkened (white outline kept).
+Xbox is a registered trademark of Microsoft. PlayStation is a registered trademark of Sony Interactive Entertainment.
