+// Wwise state changes for the InGame group (punchout_audio_trace.cpp SetState wrapper).
+// Every InGame state set counts, also one to the state it already has: the Audio gallery leaves InGame at Fight, so
+// the next real round start sets Fight again without a change.
+extern "C" void PunchOut_MenuNoteInGameState(uint32_t state) {
