+// FE button OnEvent (vtable slot +0x14 of the button classes, PO 80041490; pseudo PAL 80FF001C): r3 button, r4 ?,
+// r5 event (indexes the button's sound set: 1 = Play_FE_Hover, 4 = select). Research log: who sends the events
+// (the caller's return address) - that routine is what a pointer-free menu control would call.
