+// component slide "off" / "over" / "down" / "disabled") and, on a select, plays "out" (8017E7CC) and acts on it.
+// btn_difficulty's button object lives in a 0x40-byte block the patch leaves right before its instance ("PODF" at
+// +0x38), so it comes and goes with the package. Pressing it turns the panel into the Difficulty submenu: title
